{"seq":3,"slug":"deliverability-inbox-monitor","title":"送达率/进箱率监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-edm-email-marketing-platform/deliverability-domain/deliverability-inbox-monitor","wordCount":2059,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"送达率-进箱率监控\">送达率/进箱率监控</h1><p>送达率的监控有一个反直觉的起点：<strong>最容易被测到的指标信息量最低</strong>。SMTP 接受率（服务端返回 250 的比例）几乎总是接近 100%，因为被拒的邮件在事务期就返回了 4xx/5xx，而&quot;接受&quot;只是对方承诺承担投递责任，与进不进收件箱毫无关系。真正需要监控的三个指标是退信率、投诉率与进箱率，其中进箱率最难测、也最有用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三个指标的不同性质\">核心概念：三个指标的不同性质</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[发送批次] --&gt; B[SMTP 事务]&#10;  B --&gt;|4xx/5xx 即时拒绝| C[记录为即时退信]&#10;  B --&gt;|250 接受| D[进入对方系统]&#10;  D --&gt;|后续失败| E[DSN 异步退信]&#10;  D --&gt;|投递到垃圾箱| F[进箱率 -]&#10;  D --&gt;|投递到收件箱| G[进箱率 +]&#10;  D --&gt;|用户标记垃圾| H[投诉 FBL 回传]&#10;  F --&gt; I[种子列表测量]&#10;  G --&gt; I\">graph TD\n  A[发送批次] --&gt; B[SMTP 事务]\n  B --&gt;|4xx/5xx 即时拒绝| C[记录为即时退信]\n  B --&gt;|250 接受| D[进入对方系统]\n  D --&gt;|后续失败| E[DSN 异步退信]\n  D --&gt;|投递到垃圾箱| F[进箱率 -]\n  D --&gt;|投递到收件箱| G[进箱率 +]\n  D --&gt;|用户标记垃圾| H[投诉 FBL 回传]\n  F --&gt; I[种子列表测量]\n  G --&gt; I</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>测量方式</th>\n<th>可信度</th>\n<th>典型警戒线</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SMTP 接受率</td>\n<td>自己 MTA 的日志</td>\n<td>高（但无信息量）</td>\n<td>不设</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬退信率</td>\n<td>即时拒绝 + DSN 汇总</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>&gt;2% 需排查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投诉率</td>\n<td>FBL 回传 / 送达量</td>\n<td>中（依赖 FBL 覆盖）</td>\n<td>0.1% 警戒、0.3% 红线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进箱率</td>\n<td>种子列表面板测量</td>\n<td>中（样本代表性问题）</td>\n<td>视基线而定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>投诉率有明确的官方口径。</strong> Gmail 要求批量发送者（每天 5000 封以上）把垃圾率维持在 0.3% 以下，同时其监控指引更严格：建议让 Postmaster Tools 中的垃圾率&quot;保持在 0.10% 以下，并避免达到 0.30% 或更高&quot;（<a href=\"https://support.google.com/a/answer/81126\">Google: 邮件发送者指南</a>）。同一份指南要求同时发布 SPF 与 DKIM 并配置 DMARC 记录（策略可以是 <code>none</code>）、DKIM 密钥至少 1024 位（推荐 2048 位），以及营销与订阅类邮件必须支持一键退订并提供可见的正文退订链接。这三个数字（0.3% 红线、0.1% 目标、1024 位密钥）应当直接写进监控告警阈值，而不是留作参考值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"投诉率的分母陷阱\">投诉率的分母陷阱</h3><p>投诉率 = 投诉数 / 送达数，其中&quot;送达数&quot;的定义会造成口径差异：用<strong>发送量</strong>做分母会低估（部分邮件未送达），用<strong>SMTP 接受量</strong>做分母更接近收件方看到的口径。更精细的做法是区分&quot;发往该邮箱服务商的数量&quot;与&quot;全局数量&quot;——Gmail 的垃圾率是按发往 Gmail 的量计算的，一个全局 0.05% 的投诉率可能在 Gmail 侧显示为 0.3%，原因是投诉主要集中在某一类 Gmail 用户身上。<strong>按收件方拆分投诉率是必需的，全局数字会掩盖问题。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"进箱率的测量-种子列表法\">进箱率的测量：种子列表法</h2><p>进箱率（inbox placement rate）无法从自己的日志中得到——邮件被接受后去了哪里只有收件方知道。唯一可行的黑盒测量是<strong>种子列表（seed list）</strong>：维护一批分布在主要邮箱服务商（Gmail、Outlook、Yahoo、以及目标市场的本地服务商如 GMX、Seznam、Naver）的受控邮箱账号，把它们混入每次真实发送中，然后由测量平台登录这些账号查看邮件落在收件箱、垃圾箱还是&quot;促销&quot;标签。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;seed_panel&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;providers&quot;: [&#10;      { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;gmail&quot;, &quot;accounts&quot;: 40, &quot;regions&quot;: [&quot;US&quot;, &quot;DE&quot;, &quot;JP&quot;] },&#10;      { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;outlook&quot;, &quot;accounts&quot;: 30, &quot;regions&quot;: [&quot;US&quot;, &quot;NL&quot;, &quot;DE&quot;] },&#10;      { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;yahoo&quot;, &quot;accounts&quot;: 20, &quot;regions&quot;: [&quot;US&quot;, &quot;GB&quot;] },&#10;      { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;gmx&quot;, &quot;accounts&quot;: 15, &quot;regions&quot;: [&quot;DE&quot;] },&#10;      { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;seznam&quot;, &quot;accounts&quot;: 10, &quot;regions&quot;: [&quot;CZ&quot;] }&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;embed_ratio&quot;: 0.0005,&#10;    &quot;check_window_hours&quot;: 24,&#10;    &quot;classify&quot;: [&quot;inbox&quot;, &quot;promotions&quot;, &quot;spam&quot;, &quot;missing&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"seed_panel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"providers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gmail\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"accounts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"regions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"JP\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"outlook\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"accounts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"regions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"yahoo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"accounts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"regions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GB\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gmx\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"accounts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"regions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"seznam\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"accounts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"regions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CZ\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"embed_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0005</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"check_window_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"classify\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"inbox\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"promotions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"spam\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"missing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"样本代表性的三道坎\">样本代表性的三道坎</h3><p>种子测量的结果必须谨慎解读，它有三类系统偏差：</p>\n<p><strong>账号不是在真实运营的。</strong> 真实用户的种子邮箱有阅读、回复、往来邮件；测量账号通常只收不收。大型服务商会识别这类&quot;只进不出的账号&quot;，对其投递规则可能与真实用户不同。缓解方式是让测量账号也有一定的人工活动，或使用成熟测量服务商维护的面板。</p>\n<p><strong><code>embed_ratio</code> 决定了统计噪声。</strong> 0.0005 的比例意味着十万封发送中有 50 个种子样本。以此推算的进箱率，95% 置信区间的宽度大约是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>14</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 14\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">14%</span></span></span></span></span> 的量级（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>1.96</mn><msqrt><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 1.96\\sqrt{p(1-p)/n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">1.96</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.9</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=0.9, n=50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span>），因此<strong>单次测量的进箱率不能用于判断 5% 以内的差异</strong>。要观察小差异，必须累积多次发送的样本。</p>\n<p><strong>&quot;促销&quot;标签不是失败。</strong> Gmail 把营销邮件归入 Promotions 标签是正常分类行为，不是垃圾箱（<a href=\"https://support.google.com/mail/answer/3055016\">Gmail 分类说明</a>：Promotions 是&quot;优惠、折扣与其他促销邮件&quot;，Updates 是&quot;自动确认、通知、账单与提醒&quot;，Primary 是&quot;你认识的人发来的邮件与其他不属于其他标签的邮件&quot;）。把 Promotions 算作&quot;未进箱&quot;会得出过于悲观的结论。分类的正确做法是分开统计 inbox / promotions / spam / missing 四个桶，并关注 <strong>spam 与 missing 的变化趋势</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"官方信誉面板的使用\">官方信誉面板的使用</h2><p>除了种子测量，Gmail 的 Postmaster Tools 提供了官方的观测面：把 DKIM 的 <code>d=</code> 域或 SPF 的 Return-Path 域添加进去并完成 TXT/CNAME 验证后，可以看到垃圾率、信誉、消息认证与投递错误等数据；已验证的主域覆盖其子域（<a href=\"https://support.google.com/mail/answer/6258950\">Google: Postmaster Tools</a>）。使用时注意两点：面板只覆盖发往个人 Gmail 账号（<code>@gmail.com</code>/<code>@googlemail.com</code>）的邮件，不含 Workspace 收件人；低发送量时日数据可能因为隐私原因缺失，需要以周为粒度观察。</p>\n<p>TLS 层面的观测可以用 TLSRPT：收件域在 <code>_smtp._tls.&lt;domain&gt;</code> 发布以 <code>v=TLSRPTv1</code> 开头、含 <code>rua=</code> 的 TXT 记录，发送方则每日回传 I-JSON 格式的聚合报告，包含按策略、MX 主机、结果类型、IP 与会话数的成功/失败统计（<a href=\"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8460\">RFC 8460</a>）。它的价值在于发现&quot;STARTTLS 协商失败&quot;&quot;证书过期&quot;&quot;MTA-STS 策略不匹配&quot;这类<strong>传输层的静默问题</strong>——它们不会导致投递失败（邮件会降级为明文传输），但会削弱整条链路可信度，且从投递日志里完全看不出来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"监控指标体系与告警分层\">监控指标体系与告警分层</h2><p>把上述指标组合成一个分层的监控体系，不同层级对应不同的响应速度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>计算频率</th>\n<th>响应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实时</td>\n<td>SMTP 4xx/5xx 速率、连接失败率</td>\n<td>分钟</td>\n<td>自动化熔断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小时</td>\n<td>硬退信率、软退信率</td>\n<td>小时</td>\n<td>自动化告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日</td>\n<td>投诉率（按收件方拆分）</td>\n<td>日</td>\n<td>人工介入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周</td>\n<td>进箱率、信誉面板趋势、TLSRPT</td>\n<td>周</td>\n<td>复盘与策略调整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>月</td>\n<td>分群互动衰减、名单健康度</td>\n<td>月</td>\n<td>名单策略调整</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 按收件方拆分的投诉率，同时给出置信区间下界以判断样本是否足够&#10;WITH sent AS (&#10;  SELECT split_part(recipient_domain, &#39;.&#39;, -2) || &#39;.&#39; || split_part(recipient_domain, &#39;.&#39;, -1) AS provider,&#10;         campaign_id, count(*) AS delivered&#10;  FROM delivery_event&#10;  WHERE event_type = &#39;delivered&#39; AND occurred_at &gt;= now() - interval &#39;7 days&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY 1, 2&#10;),&#10;complaints AS (&#10;  SELECT split_part(recipient_domain, &#39;.&#39;, -2) || &#39;.&#39; || split_part(recipient_domain, &#39;.&#39;, -1) AS provider,&#10;         campaign_id, count(*) AS complaints&#10;  FROM complaint_event&#10;  WHERE occurred_at &gt;= now() - interval &#39;7 days&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY 1, 2&#10;)&#10;SELECT s.provider, s.campaign_id, s.delivered, coalesce(c.complaints, 0) AS complaints,&#10;       round(100.0 * coalesce(c.complaints, 0) / nullif(s.delivered, 0), 4) AS complaint_rate_pct,&#10;       round(100.0 * (coalesce(c.complaints, 0) / nullif(s.delivered, 0)&#10;             - 1.96 * sqrt( (coalesce(c.complaints,0)/nullif(s.delivered,0))&#10;                          * (1 - coalesce(c.complaints,0)/nullif(s.delivered,0))&#10;                          / nullif(s.delivered, 0) )), 4) AS ci_lower_pct&#10;FROM sent s LEFT JOIN complaints c USING (provider, campaign_id)&#10;ORDER BY complaint_rate_pct DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 按收件方拆分的投诉率，同时给出置信区间下界以判断样本是否足够</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> sent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> split_part(recipient_domain, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '.'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> split_part(recipient_domain, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> provider</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         campaign_id, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delivered</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delivery_event</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'delivered'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> occurred_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'7 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#