n><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">96</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sqrt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">( (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">complaints</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nullif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">delivered</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                          *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">complaints</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nullif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">delivered</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                          /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nullif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">delivered</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) )), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ci_lower_pct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> sent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> complaints c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">provider</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, campaign_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> complaint_rate_pct </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>ci_lower_pct</code> 这一列解决了&quot;小批次投诉率虚高&quot;的常见误判：一个只发了 500 封、收到 1 个投诉的批次投诉率是 0.2%，看起来已接近红线，但其置信下界是负值，说明这个数字不具区分度。只有当<strong>置信下界也超过阈值</strong>时才应当触发人工介入——否则告警会被小批次的噪声淹没。</p>\n<h3 id=\"告警必须绑定到动作\">告警必须绑定到动作</h3><p>一个只发通知的告警体系会迅速被忽略。有效的做法是给每个阈值绑定一个自动动作：硬退信率超限时自动暂停该 campaign；投诉率超限时自动把该收件方（或该分群）加入观察名单并降低发送频率；连接失败率超限时自动降低并发。人工介入应当只保留给需要判断的场景（如&quot;投诉率上升但退信率正常&quot;意味着内容或目标人群问题，而非名单问题）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>SMTP 接受率几乎没有信息量；真正要监控的是硬退信率、投诉率与进箱率。</li>\n<li>Gmail 的口径是垃圾率 0.3% 为红线、0.10% 为目标；DKIM 密钥至少 1024 位（推荐 2048）；营销与订阅邮件必须支持一键退订。</li>\n<li>投诉率必须按收件方拆分，全局数字会掩盖局部超限；分母口径要明确。</li>\n<li>进箱率只能靠种子列表黑盒测量，受三点限制：账号非真实运营、样本量决定置信区间宽度、Promotions 标签不等于失败。</li>\n<li>种子测量结果的置信区间计算是必要的，否则会把小批次噪声当作问题。</li>\n<li>TLSRPT 揭示传输层的静默降级问题（STARTTLS 失败、证书问题、MTA-STS 不匹配）。</li>\n<li>监控应分层（实时/小时/日/周/月），且阈值必须绑定自动动作，否则告警会被忽略。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸：认证配置与 DMARC 聚合报告见 <a href=\"dkim-spf-dmarc-auth\">DKIM/SPF/DMARC 认证</a>；信誉恶化后的恢复路径与预热见 <a href=\"domain-reputation-warmup\">发信域名信誉与 IP 预热</a>；投诉与退信如何进入抑制名单见 <a href=\"../subscriber-audience-seg/suppression-bounce-list\">退订/bounce/抑制名单</a>；打开率为何不能作为进箱率的替代指标见 <a href=\"../edm-compliance-analytics/open-click-conversion-track\">打开/点击/转化追踪</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"送达率/进箱率监控","id":"送达率-进箱率监控"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三个指标的不同性质","id":"核心概念-三个指标的不同性质"},{"level":3,"text":"投诉率的分母陷阱","id":"投诉率的分母陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"进箱率的测量：种子列表法","id":"进箱率的测量-种子列表法"},{"level":3,"text":"样本代表性的三道坎","id":"样本代表性的三道坎"},{"level":2,"text":"官方信誉面板的使用","id":"官方信誉面板的使用"},{"level":2,"text":"监控指标体系与告警分层","id":"监控指标体系与告警分层"},{"level":3,"text":"告警必须绑定到动作","id":"告警必须绑定到动作"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"发信域名信誉与 IP 预热","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-edm-email-marketing-platform/deliverability-domain/domain-reputation-warmup"},"next":{"title":"退订与反垃圾法（CAN-SPAM/CASL/PECR）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-edm-email-marketing-platform/edm-compliance-analytics/unsubscribe-antispam-law"}}